\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Biden threatened with communion ban over position on  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Harriet Sherwood Religion correspondent \par \uc2 657 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 June 2021\par 19:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 US bishops vote to stop pro-choice Catholics receiving eucharist\par \par \uc2 Roman Catholic bishops in the US have voted to press ahead with moves that could result in Joe Biden being banned from receiving communion because of his stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that risks increasing tensions in a divided church.\par \par \uc2 After three days of online debate, the US Conference of Catholic Bishops (USCCB) voted by three to one to draft new guidance on the eucharist. The unexpected strength of support for the move among the bishops was a rebuff to the Vatican, which had signalled its opposition.\par \par \uc2 Biden, a devout Catholic who attends Mass every weekend and carries a rosary that belonged to his late son, said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/video/2021/jun/18/joe-biden-catholic-bishops-rebuke-video"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in response to the vote}}}\uc2  that the matter was private: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t think that\u8217\'20\'19s going to happen.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Conservative bishops are behind the push to draw up a new teaching document expected to say that Catholics who diverge from the church\u8217\'20\'19s standpoint on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be denied holy communion.\par \par \uc2 Bishop Kevin Rhoades of Fort Wayne-South Bend, who proposed the motion, said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to accept the discipline that those who obstinately persist in grave sin are not to be admitted to holy communion.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2017/feb/05/us-cardinal-raymond-burke-stokes-papal-tensions-by-meeting-nationalist-in-rome"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardinal Raymond Burke}}}\uc2 , a leading conservative and critic of \uc2 Pope Francis\uc2 , has previously said that politicians who \u8220\'20\'1Cpublicly and obstinately\u8221\'20\'1D support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  are \u8220\'20\'1Capostates\u8221\'20\'1D who should not only be barred from receiving communion but deserve excommunication.\par \par \uc2 But some US bishops warned against the \u8220\'20\'1Cweaponisation\u8221\'20\'1D of the eucharist. Speaking at the USCCB meeting, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2016/oct/10/pope-francis-rejects-rightwingers-with-us-cardinals-appointment-archbishop-blase-cupich"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardinal Blase Cupich}}}\uc2 , the archbishop of Chicago, said most priests would be \u8220\'20\'1Cpuzzled to hear that bishops now want to talk about excluding people at a time when the real challenge before them is welcoming people back to the regular practice of the faith and rebuilding their communities\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The new teaching document, to be drafted by the doctrine committee of US bishops, will not be binding on individual bishops, who have the right to decide whether a parishioner should be denied communion.\par \par \uc2 Wilton Gregory of Washington and Francis Malooly of Wilmington, Delaware \u8211\'20\'13 the dioceses where Biden usually attends mass \u8211\'20\'13 have both made it clear that the president is welcome to receive communion at their churches.\par \par \uc2 Biden, only the second Catholic to occupy the White House after John Kennedy, has said his faith shapes \u8220\'20\'1Call that I do\u8221\'20\'1D and it will \u8220\'20\'1Cserve as my anchor\u8221\'20\'1D through his term in office.\par \par \uc2 On \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Biden has said he personally believes life begins at conception, but recognises others do not share his view. \u8220\'20\'1CWhat I\u8217\'20\'19m not prepared to do is impose a precise view that is borne out of my faith on other people,\u8221\'20\'1D he said in 2015.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration has lifted restrictions on federal funding for research involving human foetal tissue, rescinded a Trump policy barring organisations that refer women for abortions from receiving federal grants, and allowed women to remotely obtain a prescription for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill during the pandemic.\par \par \uc2 The Catholic church says that Catholics in public life should uphold principles consistent with its doctrine. But in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/fact-tank/2021/03/30/u-s-catholics-divided-by-party-on-whether-biden-should-be-denied-communion-over-his-abortion-stance/ft_2021-03-30_bidencommunion_03/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a survey carried out by the Pew Research Center in March}}}\uc2 , more than two-thirds of US Catholics said Biden\u8217\'20\'19s views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not disqualify him from receiving communion.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/elections/interactive/2020/exit-polls/presidential-election-exit-polls/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exit polls}}}\uc2  taken during last November\u8217\'20\'19s presidential election, just over half of US Catholics (51%) voted for Biden and 47% voted for Trump.\par \par \uc2 Catholics for Choice\uc2 , an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights group, said it was profoundly saddened by the bishops\u8217\'20\'19 vote. Jamie Manson, the group\u8217\'20\'19s president, said: \u8220\'20\'1CIn a country and church already riven with tension and division, today the bishops chose to be partisan instead of pastoral, cruel rather than Christ-like.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The bishops will hold a debate on the teaching document in November, when it will require a two-thirds majority for it to proceed.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210622eh6j002f4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
