\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18People were excited\u8217\'20\'19: Paxton Smith on her valedictorian speech for  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights\b0\par\par\uc2 Alexandra Villarreal \par \uc2 713 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 June 2021\par 17:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Texas 18-year-old says it was \u8216\'20\'18scary to take a stand\u8217\'20\'19 amid controversy \u8211\'20\'13 but speech has received rave reviews\par \par \uc2 When 18-year-old Paxton Smith used her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/jun/02/texas-valedictorian-graduation-speech-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 valedictorian address}}}\uc2  to rail against Texas\u8217\'20\'19s near-total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban last Sunday, she inspired cheers at her Dallas high school, as well as an outpouring of support for her across the country and online.\par \par \uc2 Smith had originally planned to talk about TV and media. But when it came time to address the graduating class of Lake Highlands high, she switched course to deliver a searing indictment of Texas\u8217\'20\'19s Republican leadership \u8211\'20\'13 without her school\u8217\'20\'19s approval.\par \par \uc2 Smith didn\u8217\'20\'19t tell any friends or fellow students what she had planned. And, when she warned her parents, they were apprehensive at first.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s definitely scary to take a stand on such a big stage on such a controversial issue,\u8221\'20\'1D she told \uc2 the Guardian\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Yet her speech has garnered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/littlewhitty/status/1399982526396043264"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 millions of views }}}\uc2  on social media and won praise from politicians such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HillaryClinton/status/1400127800288419840"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hillary Clinton}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/betoorourke/status/1400151466531344388"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Beto O\u8217\'20\'19Rourke}}}\uc2 . And for Smith, the most meaningful reactions have come from concerned fathers who fear for their own daughters\u8217\'20\'19 futures.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat really hits me so hard, \u8217\'20\'19cause of course a parent wants the best for their daughters,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd they\u8217\'20\'19re allowing themselves to be vulnerable, and say, \u8216\'20\'18Thank you. Thank you for protecting my daughter when I haven\u8217\'20\'19t had as much of a chance to.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Texas\u8217\'20\'19s new \u8220\'20\'1Cheartbeat\u8221\'20\'1D measure ranks among the most {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/may/19/texas-abortion-ban-law-greg-abbott"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extreme \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  bans}}}\uc2  in the US, blocking {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.texastribune.org/2021/05/18/texas-heartbeat-bill-abortions-law/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the procedure as early as six weeks}}}\uc2  into a pregnancy \u8211\'20\'13 before many women and girls even know they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant. The bill, due to come into force in September, doesn\u8217\'20\'19t include exceptions for rape or incest and allows private citizens to enforce its provisions through what could be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/may/19/texas-abortion-ban-law-greg-abbott"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a torrent of expensive and time-consuming lawsuits}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 When Smith learned in government class that the hardline policy had been signed into law by the state\u8217\'20\'19s Republican governor, she felt anger and disbelief.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m a woman, and it directly affects me,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 As she sat in her band hall, too distracted and upset to focus on a psychology assignment, she started jotting down thoughts on the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. Suddenly, she knew she had to change her valedictorian speech.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI cannot give up this platform to promote complacency and peace when there is a war on my body and a war on my rights. A war on the rights of your mothers, a war on the rights of your sisters, a war on the rights of your daughters,\u8221\'20\'1D Smith told the crowd.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe cannot stay silent.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She said she had been dreading the address until she walked onstage, when a calm washed over her. Her voice grew stronger and more impassioned as she excoriated those lawmakers who are accused of stealing the bodily autonomy of women across Texas, including her own.\par \par \uc2 Soon, people started cheering \u8211\'20\'13 primarily parents in the audience, she thinks. Despite Texas\u8217\'20\'19s reputation as a conservative bastion, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://poll.qu.edu/Poll-Release-Legacy?releaseid=2626"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sizable majority}}}\uc2  of Texas voters agree with the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s landmark Roe v Wade decision, which established the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nearly 50 years ago.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI was very surprised,\u8221\'20\'1D Smith said. \u8220\'20\'1CIt was exciting that so many people were excited that I said that up there.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The school district\u8217\'20\'19s board president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lakehighlands.advocatemag.com/2021/06/lhhs-valedictorian-graduation-speech/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Lake Highlands Advocate}}}\uc2  that Smith\u8217\'20\'19s speech had not been submitted or approved and that her actions were \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nydailynews.com/news/national/ny-texas-valedictorian-swaps-approved-speech-for-critique-of-abortion-ban-20210602-jebkuiqbejakhos3nrufu2qu64-story.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unexpected and not supported}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nydailynews.com/news/national/ny-texas-valedictorian-swaps-approved-speech-for-critique-of-abortion-ban-20210602-jebkuiqbejakhos3nrufu2qu64-story.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by the high school or district}}}\uc2 , which would try to \u8220\'20\'1Cprevent something like this from happening again\u8221\'20\'1D. Those quotes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lakehighlands.advocatemag.com/2021/06/lhhs-valedictorian-graduation-speech/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have since been}}}\uc2  amended.\par \par \uc2 But Smith remembered far more praise than pushback after her speech and she said she could count on one hand the negative messages she had received.\par \par \uc2 In fact, the sheer number of people from around the world who relate to her words had been overwhelming.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt kind of makes me sad that this is a universal issue,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CThis is one of those times where it\u8217\'20\'19s getting a voice, and it hasn\u8217\'20\'19t really had a voice that\u8217\'20\'19s very big before.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210605eh650012x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
